{"3626090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blitzkrieg Express", "steam_appid": 3626090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Earn a Steam Profile Award from the Blitzkrieg Express community!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎖️ Recreate Maxim’s run by avoiding <strong>all gear and skills upgrades</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 Try to beat as many levels as possible and share your <strong>screenshots</strong> on Steam Community Hub (inventory and level). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Get your Steam Profile Award!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>⚠️ To restart your run, type RESET24 while playing. Warning: this will erase ALL your in-game progress. Only for hardcore players willing to lose everything for the thrill!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/a32e142e6bc72f6c0b182017b22fe371.avif?t=1782726311\" width=1494 height=583 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/45965a84a095002dab0b3be9149c1c84.avif?t=1782726311\" width=707 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blitzkrieg Express</strong> is an explosive mix of shooter, puzzle, and survival. Your enemy — an armored train tearing through your land. Your mission — stop it at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.poster.avif?t=1782726311\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.webm?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.mp4?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and defend</strong> your land against the armored train in this arcade achievement-attack puzzle. Think smart, find the right sequence to create combos by destroying wagons with different bonuses to speed up and boost your cannon, and stop the train before it stops you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.poster.avif?t=1782726311\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.webm?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.mp4?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for tactical train puzzles with unique wagons and effects, and 100+ thrilling levels. </strong>Upgrade your cannon, choose your targets wisely — and take down the Armed Train General.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.poster.avif?t=1782726311\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.webm?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.mp4?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/45965a84a095002dab0b3be9149c1c84.avif?t=1782726311\" width=707 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blitzkrieg Express</strong> is an explosive mix of shooter, puzzle, and survival. Your enemy — an armored train tearing through your land. Your mission — stop it at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.poster.avif?t=1782726311\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.webm?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/e22a2701c7fd1f98e04e8972457d28d2.mp4?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and defend</strong> your land against the armored train in this arcade achievement-attack puzzle. Think smart, find the right sequence to create combos by destroying wagons with different bonuses to speed up and boost your cannon, and stop the train before it stops you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.poster.avif?t=1782726311\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.webm?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/10065b693df5fcabc7b1987c09ec5010.mp4?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for tactical train puzzles with unique wagons and effects, and 100+ thrilling levels. </strong>Upgrade your cannon, choose your targets wisely — and take down the Armed Train General.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.poster.avif?t=1782726311\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.webm?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626090/extras/54ba14e956b02d00a127803de89e67e3.mp4?t=1782726311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Survive and defend your land against the armored train in this arcade achievement-attack puzzle. Think smart, find the right sequence to create combos by destroying wagons with different bonuses to speed up and boost your cannon, and stop the train before it stops you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The WEIRDEST Tower Defense Game EVER!”<br>Maxims Zweitkanal<br><br>“It's actually oddly satisfying. I could play this for a long time.”<br>Idle Cub<br><br